  "highlights": [
    {
      "title": "Overview",
      "value": "<p>Ecole de Management Applique (EMA) is a private business school in the heart of Paris, France. Whether you're pursuing a Bachelor's degree, a Master's, or even a PhD, EMA provides a diverse range of courses. EMA ensures that you receive a top-tier education, as it holds the Qualiopi certification for the quality of its training processes.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
      "title": "Student life",
      "value": "<p>You’ll have a friendly and multicultural student life at Ecole de Management Applique. EMA has students from various backgrounds across the globe. Plus, you can join various student-run clubs and organisations, including cultural, social, and professional development ones.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
      "title": "Accommodation",
      "value": "<p>EMA does not offer on-campus housing. However, you can choose various accommodation options in the city to suit your preferences and budget.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    }
  ],
